      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `ea8d43737d6da8b0339a1964fce986cb9a325fb996b3f4435cc986c740ff2f57--4510d003_2012.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2012\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 6116969bd7ecb6b89853be0321a373fdb762edd628a4496e0d126570d1d9ec6b | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | ee66b9d805817241088f8af05bebad70385e910b01cdc96ac9623aee476f5f40 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | b0410099abaaa22a3012340118f91e2c2ae779766625ec0fe43145c7895ad8cd | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 9b8bffd85f248514cd210bd97704f57b964860dc216b0829b6efdc665cfa5b81 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 886974e6e08622286c902362ab093a563ad3caa102079dde5cae140c7cafa742 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | ab9e78cbed429882201d61737ad46e4ad7ae1f115b2720f709e923e40106e48b | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | d5212d72f8c97f0f3d1cd2dcfedc88ca46d5e4d86878d30070a26735324e0010 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 181a9f1d7b69ac459eeed3f07fc1492f19a1b92a98adfbb2f07e5079b00c6d78 | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 50f4834ea186dc841dc70221048dfd00e497b215289b40c946d00bb8c219a16a | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
